PN,30401
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has pledged to work to
OL,8,F"get everyone in for Christmas" as he
OL,9,Fcontinues to build on his vow to end
OL,10,Frough sleeping.
OL,12,FThe Prime Minister is attempting a
OL,13,Frepeat of efforts during the
OL,14,Fcoronavirus pandemic when the Everyone
OL,15,FIn scheme resulted in thousands of
OL,16,Frough sleepers across England being
OL,17,Ftaken in off the streets.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FThe latest annual national statistics,
OL,8,Fpublished by the Government in
OL,9,FFebruary, estimated there were 4,793
OL,10,Fpeople sleeping rough on a single
OL,11,Fnight in autumn 2025 in England.
OL,13,FThis was a new record high and the
OL,14,Ffourth annual increase in a row.
OL,16,FAt that stage 43% of all people
OL,17,Fsleeping rough were in London and the
OL,18,FSouth East.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FNewer data for London published last
OL,8,Fmonth showed a 10% year-on-year drop
OL,9,Fin the number of rough sleepers in the
OL,10,Fcapital, prompting a charity boss to
OL,11,Finsist ending rough sleeping in London
OL,12,Fand beyond is "within reach".
OL,14,FSome 3,959 people slept rough in the
OL,15,Fcapital between April and June this
OL,16,Fyear, research from the Combined
OL,17,FHomelessness and Information Network
OL,18,F(Chain) showed, down from 4,392 in the
OL,19,Fsame period in 2025.
OL,26,@tD@OOUtD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FThis week, the Government has
OL,8,Fcommitted to "offer everyone a route
OL,9,Foff the streets this Christmas",
OL,10,Falthough there is no defined duration
OL,11,Fas to how long local authorities might
OL,12,Fbe expected to take people in for, and
OL,13,Fit is understood to be accepted that
OL,14,Fnot every rough sleeper might take up
OL,15,Fthe offer.
OL,26,@pD@NOUqD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FMr Burnham has also said he will host
OL,8,Fwhat is being described as a first-of-
OL,9,Fits-kind national summit this autumn
OL,10,Fto "bring together leaders from across
OL,11,Fsociety ` from business, finance,
OL,12,Fcharities, health, faith communities
OL,13,Fand more ` to ask what role each of
OL,14,Fthem can play in ending rough
OL,15,Fsleeping".
OL,26,@rD@DOUwD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FThe Prime Minister, who pledged as his
OL,8,F"first instruction" on day one in No
OL,9,F10 "to end rough sleeping in our
OL,10,Fcountry", suggested people living on
OL,11,Fthe streets has begun to become
OL,12,Faccepted over the years.
OL,14,FHe said: "No-one should have to bed
OL,15,Fdown in a doorway or outside a
OL,16,Fstation. But we've seen it for so long
OL,17,Fthat it feels like Westminster has
OL,18,Fstarted to accept it.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@SO]qD@DOUrD@HO]vD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,F"I won't accept it. That's why my
OL,8,Ffirst instruction as Prime Minister
OL,9,Fwas to end rough sleeping. And it's
OL,10,Fwhy today we're getting started with a
OL,11,Fnational drive to get everyone in for
OL,12,FChristmas.
OL,14,F"Let's get people out the cold. And
OL,15,Flet's bring back hope."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOUwD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FMr Burnham has announced an additional
OL,8,F#102 million, from uncommitted budgets
OL,9,Fwithin the Ministry of Housing,
OL,10,FCommunities and Local Government
OL,11,F(MHCLG), to go towards immediate
OL,12,Froutes for people off the street this
OL,13,Fwinter, including an #8.4 million
OL,14,Fboost to the Ending Homelessness in
OL,15,FCommunities Fund, in recognition of
OL,16,Fthe work of charities, faith groups
OL,17,Fand community organisations in this
OL,18,Farea.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FThe #102 million will go alongside the
OL,8,F#340 million announced last month in
OL,9,Ffunding for new support to get long-
OL,10,Fterm rough sleepers into settled
OL,11,Faccommodation.
OL,13,FMHCLG said areas facing the greatest
OL,14,Fpressures with regard to homelessness
OL,15,Fwill get the largest share of support
OL,16,Fand that mayors will be expected to
OL,17,Fwork alongside councils to "play a
OL,18,Fleading role in driving local action
OL,19,Fto end rough sleeping" including
OL,20,Fdeciding what help is needed and where.
OL,26,@yD@\OU{D@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FGuidance to help with the drive will
OL,8,F"make clear the need to ensure
OL,9,Fadequate and accessible provision" for
OL,10,Ffemale rough sleepers who the
OL,11,Fdepartment said are often
OL,12,Funderrepresented in official
OL,13,Fstatistics and can be at greater risk
OL,14,Fof violence, abuse and exploitation.
OL,16,FLocal areas will be encouraged to
OL,17,F"consider single-sex accommodation
OL,18,Fwith specialist, intensive and trauma-
OL,19,Finformed support, for victims of
OL,20,Fdomestic abuse and sexual violence",
OL,21,Fthe department said.
OL,26,@pD@AOUqD@bO]yD@AOU|D@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner said:
OL,8,F"When the Prime Minister pledged to
OL,9,Fend rough sleeping, we said we'd move
OL,10,Furgently from words to action. Today
OL,11,Fwe're delivering on that promise.
OL,13,F"This funding will help thousands of
OL,14,Fpeople leave the streets behind, move
OL,15,Finto secure homes and get the support
OL,16,Fthey need to rebuild their lives.
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,F"Working alongside councils, mayors
OL,8,Fand charities, we're backing local
OL,9,Fareas to tackle rough sleeping at its
OL,10,Froots, giving people the security,
OL,11,Fdignity and opportunity they deserve,
OL,12,Fand restoring hope to those who have
OL,13,Fbeen let down for far too long."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FMs Rayner has previously declined to
OL,8,Fput a target deadline on the
OL,9,FGovernment's pledge to end rough
OL,10,Fsleeping, when asked about Mr
OL,11,FBurnham's commitment that his
OL,12,FGovernment would work to "finally end
OL,13,Flong-term rough sleeping across the UK
OL,14,Fat the earliest opportunity".
OL,16,FHomelessness charities welcomed the
OL,17,Fannouncement as a "strong start" that
OL,18,Fputs the country on a path to end
OL,19,Frough sleeping, while opposition
OL,20,Fcritics said it lacked detail and
OL,21,Fsubstance.
OL,26,@tD@ZOUvD@\O]yD@SOUyD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30414
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FShelter chief executive Sarah Elliott
OL,8,Fsaid: "The Prime Minister's pledge to
OL,9,Fget everyone sleeping rough off the
OL,10,Fstreets by Christmas is a game-
OL,11,Fchanging move and exactly the kind of
OL,12,Fbold leadership needed to end the
OL,13,Fhousing emergency."
OL,15,FShe added: "Tackling the most visible
OL,16,Fform of homelessness is a strong
OL,17,Fstart, but the almost 178,000 children
OL,18,Fhidden away in grim temporary
OL,19,Faccommodation also need somewhere to
OL,20,Fcall home.
OL,26,@pD@GOUuD@SO]wD@LOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30415
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,F"The Prime Minister must apply the
OL,8,Fsame unwavering ambition to delivering
OL,9,Fthe council housing revolution he
OL,10,Fpromised."
OL,12,FLord John Bird, the crossbench peer
OL,13,Fand co-founder of the Big Issue, said:
OL,14,F"Covid proved that when we decide
OL,15,Frough sleeping is unacceptable, we can
OL,16,Fact and get people in off the streets.
OL,17,FThis Christmas commitment is a welcome
OL,18,Freturn to that spirit.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@JO]vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30416
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,F"But it's important that people are
OL,8,Fnot just brought in from the cold for
OL,9,Fa few weeks, only to be sent back out
OL,10,Fagain.
OL,12,F"To that end, I'm encouraged to see
OL,13,Fthe Prime Minister is allocating
OL,14,Fmillions in tried-and-tested localised
OL,15,Fsolutions that offer wraparound
OL,16,Fsupport for long-term rough sleepers."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUxD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30417
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FCrisis chief executive Matt Downie
OL,8,Fsaid: "Today's announcement represents
OL,9,Fa clear statement that in the 21st
OL,10,Fcentury, we will not tolerate a
OL,11,Fsituation where people are having to
OL,12,Fbed down on our streets.
OL,14,F"It puts us on the path to an historic
OL,15,Fmilestone: the end of rough sleeping
OL,16,Fin England."
OL,26,@pD@GOUvD@AOUxD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30418
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FHe added: "Where access to a home
OL,8,Fisn't possible straight away,
OL,9,Fproviding good quality accommodation
OL,10,Fwith a clear plan to support people
OL,11,Finto settled housing is a vital first
OL,12,Fstep."
OL,14,FShadow housing secretary Sir James
OL,15,FCleverly said: "Andy Burnham promised
OL,16,Fto end rough sleeping in Manchester,
OL,17,Fand failed because he didn't do the
OL,18,Fhard work necessary.
OL,26,@oD@KOUtD@FO]wD@POU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30419
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,F"Now he is pledging to end it
OL,8,Fnationally without any plan for
OL,9,Fdelivery. And as with many of his
OL,10,Fother commitments, there is very
OL,11,Flittle detail on how this one will be
OL,12,Fpaid for."
OL,14,FSir James added: "Labour must come
OL,15,Fclean on what other programmes they
OL,16,Fare cutting to pay for this project.
OL,18,F"Otherwise, struggling families will
OL,19,Ffear that yet more Labour tax rises
OL,20,Fare on the horizon."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@JO]vD@ROUzD@AOU|D@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/22
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30420
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1787102284
OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FDeputy Reform UK leader Richard Tice
OL,8,Fdismissed the pledge as "yet another
OL,9,Fvague announcement with no substances
OL,10,Fwhich uses our most vulnerable for
OL,11,Fpolitical point-scoring".
OL,13,F"We'll believe it when we see it. Andy
OL,14,FBurnham's record on homelessness has
OL,15,Fleft a lot to be desired," he said.
