OL,3,CPM announces drive to get thousands of
OL,4,Crough sleepers off streets for
OL,5,CChristmas
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat housing spokesman
OL,8,FGideon Amos said "sticking plasters
OL,9,Fwon't fix the homelessness crisis",
OL,10,Fadding: "Liberal Democrats have called
OL,11,Ffor a legal 'somewhere safe to stay'
OL,12,Fduty and for councils to be given the
OL,13,Fringfenced funding they need to give
OL,14,Feveryone a real, lasting route off the
OL,15,Fstreets.
